{"clase": "<p><b>Mini-certamen de transporte.</b> 3 problemas tipo certamen: tabla balanceada, SBF inicial, óptimo y soluciones múltiples. 25 minutos cada uno.</p>", "ejemplos": [], "ejercicios": [{"q": "<p>Tres fábricas (capacidad diaria 150, 200 y 250) abastecen a cuatro clientes (demanda 150, 150, 400 y 100). Costo de fabricación: A $4, B $3, C $2. Transporte y multa por unidad faltante:</p><div class=\"tw\"><table class=\"t\"><thead><tr><th></th><th>Cl1</th><th>Cl2</th><th>Cl3</th><th>Cl4</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>A</th><td>21</td><td>25</td><td>23</td><td>24</td></tr><tr><th>B</th><td>20</td><td>21</td><td>25</td><td>23</td></tr><tr><th>C</th><td>22</td><td>19</td><td>20</td><td>21</td></tr><tr><th>Multa</th><td>32</td><td>30</td><td>33</td><td>34</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class=\"src\">C2 2023-2, Problema 1 a).</p><ol class=\"parts\"><li><b>a)</b> Construya la tabla (fabricación + transporte; el ficticio cobra la multa).</li><li><b>b)</b> Determine cuánto debe fabricar cada fábrica y a quién enviar.</li></ol>", "s": "<div class=\"solpart\"><h5>Tabla de transporte</h5><p>Oferta total = 600, demanda total = 800. Falta oferta ⇒ se agrega un <b>origen ficticio</b> con oferta 200.</p><div class=\"tw\"><table class=\"t\"><thead><tr><th></th><th>Cl1</th><th>Cl2</th><th>Cl3</th><th>Cl4</th><th>Oferta</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>A</th><td>25</td><td>29</td><td>27</td><td>28</td><td>150</td></tr><tr><th>B</th><td>23</td><td>24</td><td>28</td><td>26</td><td>200</td></tr><tr><th>C</th><td>24</td><td>21</td><td>22</td><td>23</td><td>250</td></tr><tr><th>Fic</th><td>32</td><td>30</td><td>33</td><td>34</td><td>200</td></tr><tr><th>Demanda</th><td>150</td><td>150</td><td>400</td><td>100</td><td></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><div class=\"solpart\"><h5>Solución</h5><p><b>Vogel:</b> penalidad = diferencia entre los dos costos menores de cada fila y columna; en la línea con mayor penalidad se asigna a la celda más barata.</p><ol class=\"log\"><li>Mayor penalidad = 5 (columna 3); se asigna 250 a la celda (3,3) de costo 22.</li><li>Mayor penalidad = 5 (columna 2); se asigna 150 a la celda (2,2) de costo 24.</li><li>Mayor penalidad = 3 (fila 2); se asigna 50 a la celda (2,1) de costo 23.</li><li>Mayor penalidad = 7 (columna 1); se asigna 100 a la celda (1,1) de costo 25.</li><li>Mayor penalidad = 6 (columna 3); se asigna 50 a la celda (1,3) de costo 27.</li><li>Queda una sola fila o columna: se completa con el método del costo menor.</li></ol><div class=\"tw\"><table class=\"tt\"><thead><tr><th></th><th>Cl1</th><th>Cl2</th><th>Cl3</th><th>Cl4</th><th>Oferta</th><th class=\"pen\">Penal.</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>A</th><td><span class=\"cc\">25</span><span class=\"al\">100</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">29</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">27</span><span class=\"al\">50</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">28</span></td><td class=\"sd\">150</td><td class=\"pen\">2/2/2/2/1</td></tr><tr><th>B</th><td><span class=\"cc\">23</span><span class=\"al\">50</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">24</span><span class=\"al\">150</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">28</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">26</span></td><td class=\"sd\">200</td><td class=\"pen\">1/1/3</td></tr><tr><th>C</th><td><span class=\"cc\">24</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">21</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">22</span><span class=\"al\">250</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">23</span></td><td class=\"sd\">250</td><td class=\"pen\">1</td></tr><tr><th>Fic</th><td><span class=\"cc\">32</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">30</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">33</span><span class=\"al\">100</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">34</span><span class=\"al\">100</span></td><td class=\"sd\">200</td><td class=\"pen\">2/2/1/1/1</td></tr><tr><th>Demanda</th><td class=\"sd\">150</td><td class=\"sd\">150</td><td class=\"sd\">400</td><td class=\"sd\">100</td><td></td><td></td></tr><tr><th class=\"pen\">Penal.</th><td class=\"pen\">1/2/2/7</td><td class=\"pen\">3/5</td><td class=\"pen\">5/1/1/6/6</td><td class=\"pen\">3/2/2/6/6</td><td></td><td></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Z = 25·100 + 27·50 + 23·50 + 24·150 + 22·250 + 33·100 + 34·100 = <b>20800</b>.</p><p><b>Algoritmo de transporte (u<sub>i</sub>, v<sub>j</sub>):</b></p><p class=\"it\">Iteración 1. Se fija v<sub>3</sub> = 0. Costo reducido más negativo: celda (4,2) con −2 ⇒ <b>entra</b>. Circuito: (4,2)+ → (4,3)− → (1,3)+ → (1,1)− → (2,1)+ → (2,2)−. Menor valor en celdas \"−\": 100 ⇒ <b>sale</b> la celda (1,1). Z actual = 20800.</p><div class=\"tw\"><table class=\"tt\"><thead><tr><th></th><th>Cl1</th><th>Cl2</th><th>Cl3</th><th>Cl4</th><th>Oferta</th><th>u<sub>i</sub></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>A</th><td><span class=\"cc\">25</span><span class=\"al\">100</span><span class=\"sg\">−</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">29</span><span class=\"rd\">3</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">27</span><span class=\"al\">50</span><span class=\"sg\">+</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">28</span><span class=\"rd\">0</span></td><td class=\"sd\">150</td><td class=\"uv\">27</td></tr><tr><th>B</th><td><span class=\"cc\">23</span><span class=\"al\">50</span><span class=\"sg\">+</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">24</span><span class=\"al\">150</span><span class=\"sg\">−</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">28</span><span class=\"rd\">3</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">26</span><span class=\"rd\">0</span></td><td class=\"sd\">200</td><td class=\"uv\">25</td></tr><tr><th>C</th><td><span class=\"cc\">24</span><span class=\"rd\">4</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">21</span><span class=\"rd\">0</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">22</span><span class=\"al\">250</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">23</span><span class=\"rd\">0</span></td><td class=\"sd\">250</td><td class=\"uv\">22</td></tr><tr><th>Fic</th><td><span class=\"cc\">32</span><span class=\"rd\">1</span></td><td class=\"ent\"><span class=\"cc\">30</span><span class=\"rd neg\">−2</span><span class=\"sg\">+</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">33</span><span class=\"al\">100</span><span class=\"sg\">−</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">34</span><span class=\"al\">100</span></td><td class=\"sd\">200</td><td class=\"uv\">33</td></tr><tr><th>Demanda</th><td class=\"sd\">150</td><td class=\"sd\">150</td><td class=\"sd\">400</td><td class=\"sd\">100</td><td></td><td></td></tr><tr><th>v<sub>j</sub></th><td class=\"uv\">−2</td><td class=\"uv\">−1</td><td class=\"uv\">0</td><td class=\"uv\">1</td><td></td><td></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class=\"it\">Iteración 2. Se fija u<sub>4</sub> = 0. Costo reducido más negativo: celda (2,4) con −2 ⇒ <b>entra</b>. Circuito: (2,4)+ → (2,2)− → (4,2)+ → (4,4)−. Menor valor en celdas \"−\": 50 ⇒ <b>sale</b> la celda (2,2). Z actual = 20600.</p><div class=\"tw\"><table class=\"tt\"><thead><tr><th></th><th>Cl1</th><th>Cl2</th><th>Cl3</th><th>Cl4</th><th>Oferta</th><th>u<sub>i</sub></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>A</th><td><span class=\"cc\">25</span><span class=\"rd\">2</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">29</span><span class=\"rd\">5</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">27</span><span class=\"al\">150</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">28</span><span class=\"rd\">0</span></td><td class=\"sd\">150</td><td class=\"uv\">−6</td></tr><tr><th>B</th><td><span class=\"cc\">23</span><span class=\"al\">150</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">24</span><span class=\"al\">50</span><span class=\"sg\">−</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">28</span><span class=\"rd\">1</span></td><td class=\"ent\"><span class=\"cc\">26</span><span class=\"rd neg\">−2</span><span class=\"sg\">+</span></td><td class=\"sd\">200</td><td class=\"uv\">−6</td></tr><tr><th>C</th><td><span class=\"cc\">24</span><span class=\"rd\">6</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">21</span><span class=\"rd\">2</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">22</span><span class=\"al\">250</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">23</span><span class=\"rd\">0</span></td><td class=\"sd\">250</td><td class=\"uv\">−11</td></tr><tr><th>Fic</th><td><span class=\"cc\">32</span><span class=\"rd\">3</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">30</span><span class=\"al\">100</span><span class=\"sg\">+</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">33</span><span class=\"al\">0</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">34</span><span class=\"al\">100</span><span class=\"sg\">−</span></td><td class=\"sd\">200</td><td class=\"uv\">0</td></tr><tr><th>Demanda</th><td class=\"sd\">150</td><td class=\"sd\">150</td><td class=\"sd\">400</td><td class=\"sd\">100</td><td></td><td></td></tr><tr><th>v<sub>j</sub></th><td class=\"uv\">29</td><td class=\"uv\">30</td><td class=\"uv\">33</td><td class=\"uv\">34</td><td></td><td></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class=\"it\">Iteración 3. Se fija u<sub>4</sub> = 0 (la fila/columna con más celdas básicas) y se resuelve u<sub>i</sub> + v<sub>j</sub> = c<sub>ij</sub> en las básicas. Costos reducidos c<sub>ij</sub> − u<sub>i</sub> − v<sub>j</sub> de las no básicas: todos ≥ 0 ⇒ <b>solución óptima</b>. Z = 27·150 + 23·150 + 26·50 + 22·250 + 30·150 + 34·50 = <b>20500</b></p><div class=\"tw\"><table class=\"tt\"><thead><tr><th></th><th>Cl1</th><th>Cl2</th><th>Cl3</th><th>Cl4</th><th>Oferta</th><th>u<sub>i</sub></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>A</th><td><span class=\"cc\">25</span><span class=\"rd\">0</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">29</span><span class=\"rd\">5</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">27</span><span class=\"al\">150</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">28</span><span class=\"rd\">0</span></td><td class=\"sd\">150</td><td class=\"uv\">−6</td></tr><tr><th>B</th><td><span class=\"cc\">23</span><span class=\"al\">150</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">24</span><span class=\"rd\">2</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">28</span><span class=\"rd\">3</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">26</span><span class=\"al\">50</span></td><td class=\"sd\">200</td><td class=\"uv\">−8</td></tr><tr><th>C</th><td><span class=\"cc\">24</span><span class=\"rd\">4</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">21</span><span class=\"rd\">2</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">22</span><span class=\"al\">250</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">23</span><span class=\"rd\">0</span></td><td class=\"sd\">250</td><td class=\"uv\">−11</td></tr><tr><th>Fic</th><td><span class=\"cc\">32</span><span class=\"rd\">1</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">30</span><span class=\"al\">150</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">33</span><span class=\"al\">0</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">34</span><span class=\"al\">50</span></td><td class=\"sd\">200</td><td class=\"uv\">0</td></tr><tr><th>Demanda</th><td class=\"sd\">150</td><td class=\"sd\">150</td><td class=\"sd\">400</td><td class=\"sd\">100</td><td></td><td></td></tr><tr><th>v<sub>j</sub></th><td class=\"uv\">31</td><td class=\"uv\">30</td><td class=\"uv\">33</td><td class=\"uv\">34</td><td></td><td></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p><b>Solución óptima:</b> A → Cl3: 150; B → Cl1: 150; B → Cl4: 50; C → Cl3: 250; Fic → Cl2: 150; Fic → Cl4: 50. Z* = <b>20500</b>.</p><p><b>¿Soluciones múltiples?</b> Sí: la celda no básica (A,Cl1) tiene costo reducido 0. Si entra (θ = 50) se obtiene otra solución con el mismo Z:</p><div class=\"tw\"><table class=\"tt\"><thead><tr><th></th><th>Cl1</th><th>Cl2</th><th>Cl3</th><th>Cl4</th><th>Oferta</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>A</th><td><span class=\"cc\">25</span><span class=\"al\">50</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">29</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">27</span><span class=\"al\">100</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">28</span></td><td class=\"sd\">150</td></tr><tr><th>B</th><td><span class=\"cc\">23</span><span class=\"al\">100</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">24</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">28</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">26</span><span class=\"al\">100</span></td><td class=\"sd\">200</td></tr><tr><th>C</th><td><span class=\"cc\">24</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">21</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">22</span><span class=\"al\">250</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">23</span></td><td class=\"sd\">250</td></tr><tr><th>Fic</th><td><span class=\"cc\">32</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">30</span><span class=\"al\">150</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">33</span><span class=\"al\">50</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">34</span></td><td class=\"sd\">200</td></tr><tr><th>Demanda</th><td class=\"sd\">150</td><td class=\"sd\">150</td><td class=\"sd\">400</td><td class=\"sd\">100</td><td></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Z = 25·50 + 27·100 + 23·100 + 26·100 + 22·250 + 30·150 + 33·50 = <b>20500</b>.</p></div>"}, {"q": "<p>Los centros I, II y III producen 50, 20 y 40 toneladas diarias. Los centros de consumo A, B y C necesitan 35, 35 y 22. Costos:</p><div class=\"tw\"><table class=\"t\"><thead><tr><th></th><th>A</th><th>B</th><th>C</th><th>Oferta</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>I</th><td>10</td><td>8</td><td>15</td><td>50</td></tr><tr><th>II</th><td>12</td><td>25</td><td>5</td><td>20</td></tr><tr><th>III</th><td>20</td><td>7</td><td>14</td><td>40</td></tr><tr><th>Demanda</th><td>35</td><td>35</td><td>22</td><td></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>El centro II se cerrará: debe quedar sin productos. Al menos el 40% de las toneladas de I deben transportarse.</p><p class=\"src\">C2 2024-2, Problema 2 a).</p><ol class=\"parts\"><li><b>a)</b> Construya la tabla de transporte (pista: divida I en la parte obligatoria, 40% = 20 t, y el resto, 30 t).</li><li><b>b)</b> Encuentre la solución óptima.</li></ol>", "s": "<div class=\"solpart\"><h5>Tabla de transporte</h5><p>Oferta total = 110, demanda total = 92. Sobra oferta ⇒ se agrega un <b>destino ficticio</b> con demanda 18.</p><div class=\"tw\"><table class=\"t\"><thead><tr><th></th><th>A</th><th>B</th><th>C</th><th>Fic</th><th>Oferta</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>I (obligatorio)</th><td>10</td><td>8</td><td>15</td><td>M</td><td>20</td></tr><tr><th>I (resto)</th><td>10</td><td>8</td><td>15</td><td>0</td><td>30</td></tr><tr><th>II</th><td>12</td><td>25</td><td>5</td><td>M</td><td>20</td></tr><tr><th>III</th><td>20</td><td>7</td><td>14</td><td>0</td><td>40</td></tr><tr><th>Demanda</th><td>35</td><td>35</td><td>22</td><td>18</td><td></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><div class=\"solpart\"><h5>Solución</h5><p><b>Vogel:</b> penalidad = diferencia entre los dos costos menores de cada fila y columna; en la línea con mayor penalidad se asigna a la celda más barata.</p><ol class=\"log\"><li>Mayor penalidad = 9 (columna 3); se asigna 20 a la celda (3,3) de costo 5.</li><li>Mayor penalidad = 8 (fila 2); se asigna 18 a la celda (2,4) de costo 0.</li><li>Mayor penalidad = 7 (fila 4); se asigna 35 a la celda (4,2) de costo 7.</li><li>Mayor penalidad = 6 (fila 4); se asigna 2 a la celda (4,3) de costo 14.</li><li>Queda una sola fila o columna: se completa con el método del costo menor.</li></ol><div class=\"tw\"><table class=\"tt\"><thead><tr><th></th><th>A</th><th>B</th><th>C</th><th>Fic</th><th>Oferta</th><th class=\"pen\">Penal.</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>I (obligatorio)</th><td><span class=\"cc\">10</span><span class=\"al\">20</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">8</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">15</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">M</span></td><td class=\"sd\">20</td><td class=\"pen\">2/2/2/5</td></tr><tr><th>I (resto)</th><td><span class=\"cc\">10</span><span class=\"al\">12</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">8</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">15</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">0</span><span class=\"al\">18</span></td><td class=\"sd\">30</td><td class=\"pen\">8/8/2/5</td></tr><tr><th>II</th><td><span class=\"cc\">12</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">25</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">5</span><span class=\"al\">20</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">M</span></td><td class=\"sd\">20</td><td class=\"pen\">7</td></tr><tr><th>III</th><td><span class=\"cc\">20</span><span class=\"al\">3</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">7</span><span class=\"al\">35</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">14</span><span class=\"al\">2</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">0</span></td><td class=\"sd\">40</td><td class=\"pen\">7/7/7/6</td></tr><tr><th>Demanda</th><td class=\"sd\">35</td><td class=\"sd\">35</td><td class=\"sd\">22</td><td class=\"sd\">18</td><td></td><td></td></tr><tr><th class=\"pen\">Penal.</th><td class=\"pen\">0/0/0/0</td><td class=\"pen\">1/1/1</td><td class=\"pen\">9/1/1/1</td><td class=\"pen\">0/0</td><td></td><td></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Z = 10·20 + 10·12 + 0·18 + 5·20 + 20·3 + 7·35 + 14·2 = <b>753</b>.</p><p><b>Algoritmo de transporte (u<sub>i</sub>, v<sub>j</sub>):</b></p><p class=\"it\">Iteración 1. Se fija u<sub>4</sub> = 0. Costo reducido más negativo: celda (4,4) con −10 ⇒ <b>entra</b>. Circuito: (4,4)+ → (4,1)− → (2,1)+ → (2,4)−. Menor valor en celdas \"−\": 3 ⇒ <b>sale</b> la celda (4,1). Z actual = 753.</p><div class=\"tw\"><table class=\"tt\"><thead><tr><th></th><th>A</th><th>B</th><th>C</th><th>Fic</th><th>Oferta</th><th>u<sub>i</sub></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>I (obligatorio)</th><td><span class=\"cc\">10</span><span class=\"al\">20</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">8</span><span class=\"rd\">11</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">15</span><span class=\"rd\">11</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">M</span><span class=\"rd\">M</span></td><td class=\"sd\">20</td><td class=\"uv\">−10</td></tr><tr><th>I (resto)</th><td><span class=\"cc\">10</span><span class=\"al\">12</span><span class=\"sg\">+</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">8</span><span class=\"rd\">11</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">15</span><span class=\"rd\">11</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">0</span><span class=\"al\">18</span><span class=\"sg\">−</span></td><td class=\"sd\">30</td><td class=\"uv\">−10</td></tr><tr><th>II</th><td><span class=\"cc\">12</span><span class=\"rd\">1</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">25</span><span class=\"rd\">27</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">5</span><span class=\"al\">20</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">M</span><span class=\"rd\">M−1</span></td><td class=\"sd\">20</td><td class=\"uv\">−9</td></tr><tr><th>III</th><td><span class=\"cc\">20</span><span class=\"al\">3</span><span class=\"sg\">−</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">7</span><span class=\"al\">35</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">14</span><span class=\"al\">2</span></td><td class=\"ent\"><span class=\"cc\">0</span><span class=\"rd neg\">−10</span><span class=\"sg\">+</span></td><td class=\"sd\">40</td><td class=\"uv\">0</td></tr><tr><th>Demanda</th><td class=\"sd\">35</td><td class=\"sd\">35</td><td class=\"sd\">22</td><td class=\"sd\">18</td><td></td><td></td></tr><tr><th>v<sub>j</sub></th><td class=\"uv\">20</td><td class=\"uv\">7</td><td class=\"uv\">14</td><td class=\"uv\">10</td><td></td><td></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class=\"it\">Iteración 2. Se fija u<sub>4</sub> = 0 (la fila/columna con más celdas básicas) y se resuelve u<sub>i</sub> + v<sub>j</sub> = c<sub>ij</sub> en las básicas. Costos reducidos c<sub>ij</sub> − u<sub>i</sub> − v<sub>j</sub> de las no básicas: todos ≥ 0 ⇒ <b>solución óptima</b>. Z = 10·20 + 10·15 + 0·15 + 5·20 + 7·35 + 14·2 + 0·3 = <b>723</b></p><div class=\"tw\"><table class=\"tt\"><thead><tr><th></th><th>A</th><th>B</th><th>C</th><th>Fic</th><th>Oferta</th><th>u<sub>i</sub></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>I (obligatorio)</th><td><span class=\"cc\">10</span><span class=\"al\">20</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">8</span><span class=\"rd\">1</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">15</span><span class=\"rd\">1</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">M</span><span class=\"rd\">M</span></td><td class=\"sd\">20</td><td class=\"uv\">0</td></tr><tr><th>I (resto)</th><td><span class=\"cc\">10</span><span class=\"al\">15</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">8</span><span class=\"rd\">1</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">15</span><span class=\"rd\">1</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">0</span><span class=\"al\">15</span></td><td class=\"sd\">30</td><td class=\"uv\">0</td></tr><tr><th>II</th><td><span class=\"cc\">12</span><span class=\"rd\">11</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">25</span><span class=\"rd\">27</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">5</span><span class=\"al\">20</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">M</span><span class=\"rd\">M+9</span></td><td class=\"sd\">20</td><td class=\"uv\">−9</td></tr><tr><th>III</th><td><span class=\"cc\">20</span><span class=\"rd\">10</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">7</span><span class=\"al\">35</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">14</span><span class=\"al\">2</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">0</span><span class=\"al\">3</span></td><td class=\"sd\">40</td><td class=\"uv\">0</td></tr><tr><th>Demanda</th><td class=\"sd\">35</td><td class=\"sd\">35</td><td class=\"sd\">22</td><td class=\"sd\">18</td><td></td><td></td></tr><tr><th>v<sub>j</sub></th><td class=\"uv\">10</td><td class=\"uv\">7</td><td class=\"uv\">14</td><td class=\"uv\">0</td><td></td><td></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p><b>Solución óptima:</b> I (obligatorio) → A: 20; I (resto) → A: 15; I (resto) → Fic: 15; II → C: 20; III → B: 35; III → C: 2; III → Fic: 3. Z* = <b>723</b>.</p><p><b>¿Soluciones múltiples?</b> No: todos los costos reducidos de las celdas no básicas son estrictamente positivos ⇒ la solución es única.</p></div>"}, {"q": "<p>Considere el siguiente problema de transporte (costos unitarios):</p><div class=\"tw\"><table class=\"t\"><thead><tr><th></th><th>D1</th><th>D2</th><th>D3</th><th>D4</th><th>Oferta</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>O1</th><td>12</td><td>17</td><td>2</td><td>14</td><td>45</td></tr><tr><th>O2</th><td>3</td><td>5</td><td>14</td><td>14</td><td>55</td></tr><tr><th>O3</th><td>17</td><td>14</td><td>11</td><td>10</td><td>45</td></tr><tr><th>Demanda</th><td>50</td><td>25</td><td>45</td><td>25</td><td></td></tr></tbody></table></div><ol class=\"parts\"><li><b>a)</b> SBF por Esquina Nor-Oeste.</li><li><b>b)</b> Solución óptima.</li><li><b>c)</b> ¿Soluciones múltiples?</li></ol>", "s": "<div class=\"solpart\"><h5>Tabla de transporte</h5><p>Oferta total = 145, demanda total = 145. El problema está balanceado.</p><div class=\"tw\"><table class=\"t\"><thead><tr><th></th><th>D1</th><th>D2</th><th>D3</th><th>D4</th><th>Oferta</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>O1</th><td>12</td><td>17</td><td>2</td><td>14</td><td>45</td></tr><tr><th>O2</th><td>3</td><td>5</td><td>14</td><td>14</td><td>55</td></tr><tr><th>O3</th><td>17</td><td>14</td><td>11</td><td>10</td><td>45</td></tr><tr><th>Demanda</th><td>50</td><td>25</td><td>45</td><td>25</td><td></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><div class=\"solpart\"><h5>Solución</h5><p><b>Esquina Nor-Oeste:</b> se parte en la celda (1,1), se asigna lo máximo y se avanza a la derecha o hacia abajo según se agote la demanda o la oferta.</p><div class=\"tw\"><table class=\"tt\"><thead><tr><th></th><th>D1</th><th>D2</th><th>D3</th><th>D4</th><th>Oferta</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>O1</th><td><span class=\"cc\">12</span><span class=\"al\">45</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">17</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">2</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">14</span></td><td class=\"sd\">45</td></tr><tr><th>O2</th><td><span class=\"cc\">3</span><span class=\"al\">5</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">5</span><span class=\"al\">25</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">14</span><span class=\"al\">25</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">14</span></td><td class=\"sd\">55</td></tr><tr><th>O3</th><td><span class=\"cc\">17</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">14</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">11</span><span class=\"al\">20</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">10</span><span class=\"al\">25</span></td><td class=\"sd\">45</td></tr><tr><th>Demanda</th><td class=\"sd\">50</td><td class=\"sd\">25</td><td class=\"sd\">45</td><td class=\"sd\">25</td><td></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Z = 12·45 + 3·5 + 5·25 + 14·25 + 11·20 + 10·25 = <b>1500</b>. Celdas básicas: 6 = m + n − 1 = 3+4−1.</p><p><b>Algoritmo de transporte (u<sub>i</sub>, v<sub>j</sub>):</b></p><p class=\"it\">Iteración 1. Se fija u<sub>2</sub> = 0. Costo reducido más negativo: celda (1,3) con −21 ⇒ <b>entra</b>. Circuito: (1,3)+ → (1,1)− → (2,1)+ → (2,3)−. Menor valor en celdas \"−\": 25 ⇒ <b>sale</b> la celda (2,3). Z actual = 1500.</p><div class=\"tw\"><table class=\"tt\"><thead><tr><th></th><th>D1</th><th>D2</th><th>D3</th><th>D4</th><th>Oferta</th><th>u<sub>i</sub></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>O1</th><td><span class=\"cc\">12</span><span class=\"al\">45</span><span class=\"sg\">−</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">17</span><span class=\"rd\">3</span></td><td class=\"ent\"><span class=\"cc\">2</span><span class=\"rd neg\">−21</span><span class=\"sg\">+</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">14</span><span class=\"rd neg\">−8</span></td><td class=\"sd\">45</td><td class=\"uv\">9</td></tr><tr><th>O2</th><td><span class=\"cc\">3</span><span class=\"al\">5</span><span class=\"sg\">+</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">5</span><span class=\"al\">25</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">14</span><span class=\"al\">25</span><span class=\"sg\">−</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">14</span><span class=\"rd\">1</span></td><td class=\"sd\">55</td><td class=\"uv\">0</td></tr><tr><th>O3</th><td><span class=\"cc\">17</span><span class=\"rd\">17</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">14</span><span class=\"rd\">12</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">11</span><span class=\"al\">20</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">10</span><span class=\"al\">25</span></td><td class=\"sd\">45</td><td class=\"uv\">−3</td></tr><tr><th>Demanda</th><td class=\"sd\">50</td><td class=\"sd\">25</td><td class=\"sd\">45</td><td class=\"sd\">25</td><td></td><td></td></tr><tr><th>v<sub>j</sub></th><td class=\"uv\">3</td><td class=\"uv\">5</td><td class=\"uv\">14</td><td class=\"uv\">13</td><td></td><td></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class=\"it\">Iteración 2. Se fija u<sub>1</sub> = 0. Costo reducido más negativo: celda (3,2) con −9 ⇒ <b>entra</b>. Circuito: (3,2)+ → (3,3)− → (1,3)+ → (1,1)− → (2,1)+ → (2,2)−. Menor valor en celdas \"−\": 20 ⇒ <b>sale</b> la celda (1,1). Z actual = 975.</p><div class=\"tw\"><table class=\"tt\"><thead><tr><th></th><th>D1</th><th>D2</th><th>D3</th><th>D4</th><th>Oferta</th><th>u<sub>i</sub></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>O1</th><td><span class=\"cc\">12</span><span class=\"al\">20</span><span class=\"sg\">−</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">17</span><span class=\"rd\">3</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">2</span><span class=\"al\">25</span><span class=\"sg\">+</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">14</span><span class=\"rd\">13</span></td><td class=\"sd\">45</td><td class=\"uv\">0</td></tr><tr><th>O2</th><td><span class=\"cc\">3</span><span class=\"al\">30</span><span class=\"sg\">+</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">5</span><span class=\"al\">25</span><span class=\"sg\">−</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">14</span><span class=\"rd\">21</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">14</span><span class=\"rd\">22</span></td><td class=\"sd\">55</td><td class=\"uv\">−9</td></tr><tr><th>O3</th><td><span class=\"cc\">17</span><span class=\"rd neg\">−4</span></td><td class=\"ent\"><span class=\"cc\">14</span><span class=\"rd neg\">−9</span><span class=\"sg\">+</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">11</span><span class=\"al\">20</span><span class=\"sg\">−</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">10</span><span class=\"al\">25</span></td><td class=\"sd\">45</td><td class=\"uv\">9</td></tr><tr><th>Demanda</th><td class=\"sd\">50</td><td class=\"sd\">25</td><td class=\"sd\">45</td><td class=\"sd\">25</td><td></td><td></td></tr><tr><th>v<sub>j</sub></th><td class=\"uv\">12</td><td class=\"uv\">14</td><td class=\"uv\">2</td><td class=\"uv\">1</td><td></td><td></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class=\"it\">Iteración 3. Se fija u<sub>3</sub> = 0 (la fila/columna con más celdas básicas) y se resuelve u<sub>i</sub> + v<sub>j</sub> = c<sub>ij</sub> en las básicas. Costos reducidos c<sub>ij</sub> − u<sub>i</sub> − v<sub>j</sub> de las no básicas: todos ≥ 0 ⇒ <b>solución óptima</b>. Z = 2·45 + 3·50 + 5·5 + 14·20 + 10·25 = <b>795</b></p><div class=\"tw\"><table class=\"tt\"><thead><tr><th></th><th>D1</th><th>D2</th><th>D3</th><th>D4</th><th>Oferta</th><th>u<sub>i</sub></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>O1</th><td><span class=\"cc\">12</span><span class=\"rd\">9</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">17</span><span class=\"rd\">12</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">2</span><span class=\"al\">45</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">14</span><span class=\"rd\">13</span></td><td class=\"sd\">45</td><td class=\"uv\">−9</td></tr><tr><th>O2</th><td><span class=\"cc\">3</span><span class=\"al\">50</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">5</span><span class=\"al\">5</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">14</span><span class=\"rd\">12</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">14</span><span class=\"rd\">13</span></td><td class=\"sd\">55</td><td class=\"uv\">−9</td></tr><tr><th>O3</th><td><span class=\"cc\">17</span><span class=\"rd\">5</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">14</span><span class=\"al\">20</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">11</span><span class=\"al\">0</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">10</span><span class=\"al\">25</span></td><td class=\"sd\">45</td><td class=\"uv\">0</td></tr><tr><th>Demanda</th><td class=\"sd\">50</td><td class=\"sd\">25</td><td class=\"sd\">45</td><td class=\"sd\">25</td><td></td><td></td></tr><tr><th>v<sub>j</sub></th><td class=\"uv\">12</td><td class=\"uv\">14</td><td class=\"uv\">11</td><td class=\"uv\">10</td><td></td><td></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p><b>Solución óptima:</b> O1 → D3: 45; O2 → D1: 50; O2 → D2: 5; O3 → D2: 20; O3 → D4: 25. Z* = <b>795</b>.</p><p><b>¿Soluciones múltiples?</b> No: todos los costos reducidos de las celdas no básicas son estrictamente positivos ⇒ la solución es única.</p></div>"}]}